  m_text: In the center you are shown a berry, and you need to look at which line
    the very last ball is and press the button under it. For each correctly pressed
    button you are given 1 second and after each correctly pressed button the time
    allotted to you decreases by 6 percent. That is, first you have +1, then +0.94,
    +0.88, +0.8, etc. Under the lines you have a time display, the maximum you can
    have is 10 seconds
